        "y0": 0.57118163821271,
        "x1": 0.8811078964150988,
        "y1": 0.5843107640702849
      },
      "text": "80,1% of the respondents are man, and 19,9 % of them are woman. Their average age is 41,18. 46,1% of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
