        "y1": 0.6001065437612505
      },
      "text": "the respondents are bachelor; 22,7% of them have master, %2,8 have PhD degree. 57,4% of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
