        "x1": 0.8825794020123476,
        "y1": 0.6316981031431819
      },
      "text": "and 19,9 % of them have 3000-4000 TL monthly income. 34% of the respondents have an experience",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
